{"id": "section-body-03111", "title": "Notifiable diseases", "chapterId": "chapter-four", "blocks": [{"id": "body-03111", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading3", "text": "CHAPTER FOUR NOTIFIABLE DISEASES", "runs": [{"text": "CHAPTER FOUR "}, {"text": "NOTIFIABLE"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "DISEASES"}], "level": 3}, {"id": "body-03112", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Notifiable Diseases, conditions and events usually pose a great public health threat, with a potential of international spread. They require immediate notification by health personnel (clinical, laboratory, environmental, etc.), to health authorities, as required by the International Health Regulations (IHR 2005). Notification is mandatory, to ensure prompt and effective response, to avoid further spread and to prevent deaths.", "runs": [{"text": "Notifiable"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Diseases,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "conditions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "events"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "usually"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pose"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "great"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "public"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "health"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "threat,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "potential"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "international"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "spread. They require immediate notification by health personnel (clinical, laboratory, environmental, etc.), to health authorities, as required by the International Health Regulations (IHR 2005). Notification is mandatory, to ensure prompt and effective response, to avoid further spread and to prevent deaths."}]}, {"id": "body-03113-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Note:", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}]}, {"id": "body-03113-textbox1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Immediately notify the 